<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>AI FUSION | Bharat ka AI Platform</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:white;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff9933 0%,#fff 38%,#138808 100%);background-attachment:fixed;min-height:100vh}
nav{padding:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#071226;color:white}
.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#5be7ff}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:65px 20px 35px;color:#071226}
.chakra{font-size:90px;animation:spin 15s linear infinite;display:inline-block}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
h1{font-size:clamp(35px,8vw,65px);margin:15px 0}
.hero p{font-size:18px}
button{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:13px 20px;background:#071226;color:white;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
section{padding:25px 18px 50px}
h2{text-align:center;color:#071226}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:15px;max-width:950px;margin:25px auto}
.card{background:#071226;color:white;border:1px solid #5be7ff;border-radius:17px;padding:22px 12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 8px 25px #07122630}
.card span{font-size:30px;display:block;margin-bottom:12px}
footer{text-align:center;background:#071226;padding:20px;color:white}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><div class="logo">🇮🇳 AI FUSION</div><div>BHARAT 🇮🇳</div></nav>
<header class="hero">
<div class="chakra">☸️</div>
<h1>AI FUSION</h1>
<p>Bharat ka AI Platform</p>
<p>One Platform. Endless Possibilities.</p>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('tools').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Explore Tools ↓</button>
</header>
<section id="tools">
<h2>Explore Your Tools</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><span>💬</span>AI Chat</div>
<div class="card"><span>🖼️</span>Image Studio</div>
<div class="card"><span>🎬</span>Video Studio</div>
<div class="card"><span>🎙️</span>Voice Studio</div>
<div class="card"><span>💻</span>Code Studio</div>
<div class="card"><span>🔍</span>AI Search</div>
<div class="card"><span>📚</span>Study Assistant</div>
<div class="card"><span>💳</span>Instant Pay Demo</div>
</div>
</section>
<footer>Made with ❤️ in Bharat | AI FUSION</footer>
</body>
</html>
